  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large copper mug over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced deodeok root and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the port wine to the copper mug and bring to a boil, scraping the bottom to deglaze the fond.",
    "Add the chicken broth, dried thyme, bay leaves, salt, and black pepper to the copper mug.",
    "Bring the stew to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the bay leaves and serve the stew hot.",
    "Serve the stew in the copper mug for a comforting and rustic presentation."
